  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "My family sits together at the table for dinner. I am hungry after a long day at school. There is rice on my plate and soup in my bowl. I use a spoon to taste the soup first. Then I take my fork and eat some chicken. We share the food and talk about our day. My little brother asks for another small bowl of rice. Soon I am full, so I put my spoon down. Everyone is happy to spend this time together.",
    "textZh": "我的家人一起坐在桌邊吃晚餐。上了一整天的課，我肚子餓了。我的盤子裡有米飯，碗裡有湯。我先用湯匙品嚐湯。接著我拿起叉子，吃一些雞肉。我們分享食物，聊聊今天的事。弟弟想再吃一小碗米飯。很快我吃飽了，所以放下湯匙。大家都很開心能一起度過這段時間。",
